THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE

Every distribution of this program carries its dependencies in lib/,
each as the unmodified jar its project publishes. doc/legal/README.md
lists them with the license each is used under and the notices those
licenses ask to travel with them; the license texts are beside it in
doc/legal/.


THE BUNDLED RUNTIME

The archives whose name carries an operating system and an architecture
also contain a trimmed OpenJDK build, under runtime/. That is a
redistribution of OpenJDK, which is licensed under the GNU General
Public License, Version 2, with the OpenJDK Assembly Exception. Its own
license files travel with it, under runtime/legal/, one directory per
module.

The portable archive contains no runtime and is unaffected by this.
